<title>USA: Merrill Lynch to buy Australia's McIntosh.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch to buy Australia's McIntosh.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc is expected to announce Monday night the acquisition of Australia's McIntosh Securities Ltd for A$114.4 million, or A$1.40 per share, sources close to the situation said.</p>
</text>
